{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0<strong>The highly rated SRPG &quot;STRANGER SAGA,&quot; which ranked high on Japanese distribution sites, is finally coming to Steam!</strong><br><strong>Train ordinary citizens into elite warriors and overcome fierce tactical battles!</strong> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821860/extras/\u30b9\u30c6\u30fc\u30b845_BTLen.png?t=1750592511\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;STRANGER SAGA&quot; is a turn-based SRPG where you lead a resistance army against a mighty enemy force.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The key to victory lies with the &quot;Civilians&quot;\u2014ordinary people with extraordinary potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Civilians start off weak but possess immense hidden abilities that unlock powerful combat skills as they grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are free to choose each Civilian's class path: Knight, Soldier, Scout, Barbarian, Archer, or Mage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build the ultimate team of your own design!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0<strong>A safe and beginner-friendly SRPG experience!</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821860/extras/\u30b9\u30c6\u30fc\u30b828en.png?t=1750592511\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reliable turn-by-turn saving system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Units reduced to 0 HP in battle can return in the next stage without major penalties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even if you are defeated, you can carry over earned experience points and money, allowing you to retry and grow stronger after each attempt\u2014victory is always possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No penalties for the number of continues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, your total turn count will be recorded. If you love optimizing for minimum turns, try challenging yourself!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(*Note: There are no unlockable features based on total turn counts.*)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0<strong>Jump into the action with an opening scene that ends in just 20 seconds!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821860/extras/\u30b9\u30c6\u30fc\u30b801en.png?t=1750592511\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect for players who want to dive into gameplay without long introductions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 chapters, 47 stages in total.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">24 unique allies to recruit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character gets an individual epilogue after the ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expert Mode unlocks after clearing the main game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Development Tool</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SRPG STUDIO</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3821860?t=1750592511","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821860/09a3cf5445bacbda91d41e423981fcb7b1dfb6e8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750592511","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821860/bc01d0dae97ed61de32308abaa8afd8afe63eef7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750592511","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821860/bc01d0dae97ed61de32308abaa8afd8afe63eef7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750592511","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0<strong>The highly rated SRPG &quot;STRANGER SAGA,&quot; which ranked high on Japanese distribution sites, is finally coming to Steam!</strong><br><strong>Train ordinary citizens into elite warriors and overcome fierce tactical battles!</strong> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821860/extras/\u30b9\u30c6\u30fc\u30b845_BTLen.png?t=1750592511\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;STRANGER SAGA&quot; is a turn-based SRPG where you lead a resistance army against a mighty enemy force.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The key to victory lies with the &quot;Civilians&quot;\u2014ordinary people with extraordinary potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Civilians start off weak but possess immense hidden abilities that unlock powerful combat skills as they grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are free to choose each Civilian's class path: Knight, Soldier, Scout, Barbarian, Archer, or Mage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build the ultimate team of your own design!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0<strong>A safe and beginner-friendly SRPG experience!</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821860/extras/\u30b9\u30c6\u30fc\u30b828en.png?t=1750592511\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reliable turn-by-turn saving system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Units reduced to 0 HP in battle can return in the next stage without major penalties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even if you are defeated, you can carry over earned experience points and money, allowing you to retry and grow stronger after each attempt\u2014victory is always possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No penalties for the number of continues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, your total turn count will be recorded. If you love optimizing for minimum turns, try challenging yourself!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(*Note: There are no unlockable features based on total turn counts.*)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0<strong>Jump into the action with an opening scene that ends in just 20 seconds!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821860/extras/\u30b9\u30c6\u30fc\u30b801en.png?t=1750592511\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect for players who want to dive into gameplay without long introductions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 chapters, 47 stages in total.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">24 unique allies to recruit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character gets an individual epilogue after the ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expert Mode unlocks after clearing the main game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Development Tool</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SRPG STUDIO</p>","developers":["\u30ec\u30c8\u30ed\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u306e\u624b\u5fdc\u3048\u3068\u30d0\u30e9\u30f3\u30b9\u3092\u8ffd\u6c42\u3059\u308b\u30c7\u30b6\u30a4\u30f3\u5de5\u623f"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821860/16acbcaf98ec8d1e348c1e78eaee1